load @term/seed/code/algebra/exterior
  find exterior-algebra

# A multivector: a sum of blades of different grades in a geometric or exterior algebra, the general element that may mix
# a scalar, a vector, an area, and a volume at once. Multivectors are what the geometric product acts on, and a rotation
# is a multivector (an even one) acting by conjugation. The form carries the exterior algebra the multivector lives in.
form multivector
  link algebra, like exterior-algebra
